OL,3,AMystery of man found dead in wetsuit
OL,4,Adeepens as inquest questions ethnicity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unidentified man whose body was
OL,7,Fdiscovered in a reservoir in Powys two
OL,8,Fyears ago may not have been of white
OL,9,Fethnicity as previously thought, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FThe body of the man, who was wearing an
OL,13,Fopen water swimming wetsuit, was found
OL,14,Fby a dogwalker at the Claerwen
OL,15,FReservoir near Rhayader in October
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FDespite a major international police
OL,19,Fappeal and the use of ground-breaking
OL,20,Ffacial reimaging techniques, his
OL,21,Fidentity and the cause of his death
OL,22,Fremain a mystery.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
