OL,3,AMystery of man found dead in wetsuit
OL,4,Adeepens as inquest questions ethnicity
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Patricia Morgan told detectives
OL,7,Fto analyse a liver sample given to the
OL,8,Fpolice two years ago which was never
OL,9,Ftested. She said she wanted to explore
OL,10,F"this further line of inquiry" before
OL,11,Freaching a conclusion.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
